space/memories/preferences/deepseek-harness-default-workspace/openviking备份范围偏好.md\\\" type=\\\"preferences\\\" score=\\\"0.77\\\" detail=\\\"uri\\\" />\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_afdeab481b514c208129f04d1336ff50", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 1748, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-10T06:29:55.769Z", "peer_id": "deepseek-harness-default-workspace"}
