{"id": "msg_293c61388ee94ac3aedc70ec83f5533c", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_cursor_1b17b13f696b846f4493897b_2_1", "tool_name": "mcp__openviking__search", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/su_housing_c_tech/zsimage_subpackage_infer_fix.md\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.79\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# ZsImage分包路径自动推断修复\\n  ## 问题原因\\n  ## 修复内容\\n  ## 验证与归属\\n\\n苏住房C小程序中因静态资源主包路径解析错误导致图片加载500，已通过路由自动推断分包修复。\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/peers/gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-suzhufang-fe-zhi2-mobile-query-h5-c-unlimited/memories/preferences/user\\\" type=\\\"preferences\\\" score=\\\"0.77\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# Preferences Overview\\n**User:** user\\n**Topic:** 苏住房防汛C端导航栏处理\\n\\n- [苏住房防汛C端导航栏处理](./苏住房防汛c端导航栏处理.md)\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/peers/gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-fangdichan-fe-zhi3-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited/memories/entities/缺陷任务/zentao_bug_6315.md\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.79\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# 禅道Bug 6315\\n  ## 基本信息\\n  ## 附件与线索\\n  ## 处理流程\\n\\n房产管理系统zhi2-web-admin新提缺陷（分析中），由 zhunan 提交、指派 tiany，暂无备注。\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/peers/gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-huaian-all-wuguan-fe-zhi2-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited/memories/events/2026/11/06/技能补充父任务查询规则.md\\\" type=\\\"events\\\" score=\\\"0.78\\\" detail=\\\"uri\\\" />\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/peers/gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-suzhufang-fe-zhi2-mobile-query-h5-c-unlimited/memories/entities/技术模式\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.78\\\" detail=\\\"uri\\\" />\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_293c61388ee94ac3aedc70ec83f5533c", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 1361, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-10T06:30:11.286Z", "peer_id": "deepseek-harness-default-workspace"}
